- **Comb Sort** is a variation of Bubble Sort that improves performance by comparing elements that are far apart.\n- The `gap` starts as the length of the list and is reduced by a shrink factor (typically 1.3) in each iteration.\n- The process continues until the gap is 1 and no swaps are made, indicating the list is sorted.\n\n### Test Cases:\n```python\nassert comb_sort([5, 15, 37, 25, 79]) == [5, 15, 25, 37, 79]\nassert comb_sort([41, 32, 15, 19, 22]) == [15, 19, 22, 32, 41]\nassert comb_sort([99, 15, 13, 47]) == [13, 15, 47, 99]\n```\n\nAll assertions will pass with this implementation.", "decode_seconds": 7.186391212977469, "draft_calls": 201, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 200, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "4fcd41bc29116af3c44df83355289919417a1fb73f9568f800c5620b22fd3c2d", "method": "relay_early", "output_hash": "63e6dc6f67babc63aa59b84b50b1165a098db3e65d2e097dfd13d2c0d6849a9f", "output_tokens": 355, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20802005504, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20986200064, "problem_id": "Mbpp/71", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 1051.0476818084717, "prefill_full_target": 35.47110366821289, "prefill_relay": 0.1372160017490387, "relay": 40.602656066417694, "unattributed_runtime": 82.56708937883377, "verification_full_target": 6014.08584022522}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15,